    "sharedInstructionsHtml": "<section class=\"source-page-card question-shared-instructions\" data-question-shared-instructions><div class=\"page-kicker\">全大問共通</div><h2>2025年度 一般選抜 医学部 数学</h2><p class=\"prose\">数学（100分）</p></section>",
